# Office lock files. Word writes `~$name.docx` beside a document while it is
# open, so one appeared at `src/~$ngle_tech_spec.docx` mid-session — inside the
# SOURCE tree, untracked, and two characters away from being swept into a
# `git add -A`. It is 162 bytes of the author's username and nothing else.
~$*
